# rpg_space_fridge.phases.pdl - the ship's FRIDGE and FOOD SEEKING (owner 2026-10-28: "lets add some food seeking, and a refrigerator on the ship, with lots of different food in its inventory ... lets see if it really works").
# Runner: ops/+x/playthrough_op.+x run play/phases/rpg_space_fridge.phases.pdl (a scratch house under /tmp; nothing live is touched). Every pet step below is one `walk` verb = one ai_step of the active pet (Ember, party 0).
# Geometry the expected values come from: the fridge stands at foods.pdl FRIDGE x=1 y=5 (local to the ship footprint at desk (2,2)) = desk cells (3,7) and (3,8) in the quarters; cells next to it: (4,7) (4,8) (3,9) ((3,6) is a cabinet). Hunger limits seek 40 / eat 25.
# Nourishment (foods.pdl): the stocked kind with the LARGEST value <= the hunger is eaten, and a pet next to the fridge keeps eating while its hunger is at least 25: hunger 70 -> ration pack (40) -> 30 -> paste tube (30) -> 0; hunger 80 -> the last ration pack -> 40 -> space stew (35) -> 5.
GAME | rpg-space | rpg_space
EVENTS | yes
NEEDS | &.widgits/world-ops/ops/+x/wo.+x
# the rpg-space skin text-includes the shared petslike core and its helpers (the scratch house has only what is listed)
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_core.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_toolbar.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_sky.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_footer.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_nudge.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/kh_state_notify.h
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/csv_frames.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_skin_lib.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_autotile.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_life.c
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_gen.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_seed.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_zoom.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_orbit.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_check.+x
# the planet pages are painted from RPG Maker sheets (the assets live above the house)
NEEDS | ../../../#.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_A5.png | #.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_A5.png
NEEDS | ../../../#.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_B.png | #.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_B.png
CFLAGS | -I$T/@.apps/rpg-space/ops
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/rpg-space-pchq/pieces/ship_01/model.txt
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/foods.pdl
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/+x/fridge_op.+x
INIT | state/pet_ember.txt | room=quarters\nx=8\ny=8\ndir=1\nsteps=5\ntx=-1\nty=-1\n
INIT | state/life_ember.txt | hp=20\nhunger=70\ndead=0\ndeaths=0\ninv=bread:5\n

PHASE | p1_hungry_in_the_quarters | a pet at hunger 70 in the quarters walks to a cell next to the fridge and eats by itself, until it is under the eat limit (two meals: 70 to 30 to 0) | food seeking, fridge, need changes a choice
DO | fridge | status
SAY | kinds=14 total=62 | a-new-fridge-holds-fourteen-kinds-and-sixty-two-portions
HAS | state/fridge.txt | hydro_apple=6 | the-fridge-file-was-seeded-from-the-STOCK-rows
